). Catalog states 'Enrollment in the Behavioral Health Emphasis is currently paused until further notice'. BEH 211/221/231/241 list 'Co-requisite: GEN 111 and GEN 162'; BEH 299 requires BEH 201 plus the same co-requisites.",
